<title>HUNGARY: C.Euro CESI falls as Polish, Czech shrs end lower.</title>
<headline>C.Euro CESI falls as Polish, Czech shrs end lower.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index slipped on Thursday to close at 1,474.91 points, down 4.22 points or 0.29 percent, the Budapest Stock Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index fell mainly because of the losses of Polish and Czech shares.</p>
<p>The index, which has been published since February 1, reflects trends of 50 shares on the Budapest, Prague and Warsaw bourses.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
